@architecture.layered

Purpose:
  Traditional layered architecture.

Owns: references\architecture\layered.sdd
UseWhen:
  - simple to medium complexity
  - small team
  - well-understood domain

AvoidWhen:
  - need high testability
  - framework coupling is a concern
  - complex domain logic

Why:
  Simple, familiar, and sufficient for many applications.

TradeOffs:
  + Easy to understand
  + Quick to implement
  - Framework coupling
  - Hard to test in isolation

Related:
  @architecture.clean
  @architecture.hexagonal

Examples:
  @project.simple-crud
  @project.admin-panel

State: +
